# Bot token from api.slack.com/apps → your app → OAuth & Permissions. Starts xoxb-. Needs the chat:write scope, and the bot must be invited to the channel.
#   required · SECRET — leave empty here, set it in .env.local
#   override: HARRY_SLACK_BOT_TOKEN
export BOT_TOKEN=

# Where messages go — a channel id like C0123456789, or a name like #harry. No default: any default would be somebody else's workspace.
#   required
#   override: HARRY_SLACK_CHANNEL
export CHANNEL=
